<title>UK: TABLE-Halma year pre-tax rises 10 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Halma year pre-tax rises 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.35		   vs 8.58</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.868		  vs 1.556</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.078		  vs 2.564</p>
<p> Pre-tax		    37.1		   vs 33.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   200.1		  vs 173.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 38.8 and 40.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Halma Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
